# Greatness Source

This source introduces Greatness as a mental model — a conceptual tool for navigating complexity through pattern and relationship recognition. It is referenced via Stephen R. Covey's *The 8th Habit: From Effectiveness to Greatness*, which frames greatness not merely as an outcome but as a framework for interpreting and engaging with the world at a higher level than mere effectiveness.
